{"id":"n89815-1-7","stage":2,"title":"치우다 · 拿走","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89815-1-7-1","ko":"야! 텔레비전 안 보이니까 머리 좀 치워.","zh":"喂，你的头挡住电视了，挪一下。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"야!","meaning":"喂","explanation":"야：喂","readings":[{"term":"야","audio":"/audio/08945f015d460ad9b44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58149","senseId":"2","lemma":"야","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"텔레비전","meaning":"电视，电视机","explanation":"텔레비전：电视，电视机","readings":[{"term":"텔레비전","audio":"/audio/f5472a609d9fa7b0176c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27373","senseId":"1","lemma":"텔레비전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보이니까","meaning":"可见，看得到","explanation":"보이다：可见，看得到；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"3","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"머리","meaning":"头","explanation":"머리：头","readings":[{"term":"머리","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66234","senseId":"1","lemma":"머리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"치워.","meaning":"拿走，拿开，搬走，移开，放下","explanation":"치우다：拿走，拿开，搬走，移开，放下；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"치우다","audio":"/audio/2e26bfacf9dbdb051cd0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89815","senseId":"1","lemma":"치우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"08945f015d460ad9","term":"야","zh":"喂","audio":"/audio/08945f015d460ad9b44c.mp3","entryId":"58149","definition":"大人叫孩子时，或者年龄相等的人之间招呼时用的词语。","pronunciation":["야ː"]},{"id":"f5472a609d9fa7b0","term":"텔레비전","zh":"电视，电视机","audio":"/audio/f5472a609d9fa7b0176c.mp3","entryId":"27373","definition":"接收电视台以电波传送的图像与声音后使其显示出来的机器。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"可见，看得到","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"某种结果出来。","pronunciation":["보이다"]},{"id":"74eee3ddf202a62b","term":"머리","zh":"头","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3","entryId":"66234","definition":"在人或动物身体中，包括脸和头发的脖子以上的部分。","pronunciation":["머리"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"2e26bfacf9dbdb05","term":"치우다","zh":"拿走，拿开，搬走，移开，放下","audio":"/audio/2e26bfacf9dbdb051cd0.mp3","entryId":"89815","definition":"把东西搬到别的地方去。","pronunciation":["치우다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ffd7d2e1c27f35948810.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n89815-1-7-2","ko":"형이 다른 데 앉으면 되잖아!","zh":"哥，你坐别的地方不就行了！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"형이","meaning":"哥，哥哥","explanation":"형：哥，哥哥；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"형","audio":"/audio/997d7178d3aa00dd51c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20286","senseId":"2","lemma":"형","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"다른：其他，别的","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64530","senseId":"1","lemma":"다른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"데","meaning":"处所，地方。","explanation":"데：处所，地方。","readings":[{"term":"데","audio":"/audio/16cb0f76ae2e2fc7131f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47455","senseId":"1","lemma":"데","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앉으면","meaning":"坐","explanation":"앉다：坐；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"앉다","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71463","senseId":"1","lemma":"앉다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되잖아!","meaning":"能，行","explanation":"되다：能，行；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"997d7178d3aa00dd","term":"형","zh":"哥，哥哥","audio":"/audio/997d7178d3aa00dd51c9.mp3","entryId":"20286","definition":"男子用于亲切地指称或称呼比自己年长的男性。","pronunciation":["형"]},{"id":"f1f4ce417552e197","term":"다른","zh":"其他，别的","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3","entryId":"64530","definition":"除相关之外的。","pronunciation":["다른"]},{"id":"16cb0f76ae2e2fc7","term":"데","zh":"处所，地方。","audio":"/audio/16cb0f76ae2e2fc7131f.mp3","entryId":"47455","definition":"处所，地方。","pronunciation":["데"]},{"id":"17e77d3fb6b2dbdb","term":"앉다","zh":"坐","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3","entryId":"71463","definition":"挺直上半身，将臀部置于别的物体或地上以支持身体的重量。","pronunciation":["안따"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"能，行","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情可行或被允许。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8654ba6e56c844c5ab9a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.457,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=89815","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":72,"sequenceScore":1.9705,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["哥，你坐别的地方不就行了！","这家餐厅什么好吃？","喂，你的头挡住电视了，挪一下。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["哥，你坐别的地方不就行了！","喂，你的头挡住电视了，挪一下。","这家餐厅什么好吃？"],"answer":0}]}
